{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"95842","tmdb_id":"movie/95842","media_type":"movie","title":"庆余年","original_title":"庆余年","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHJvPo9CLpXwX1ncDg6uD0QJIZo.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1CqlLecfpcuOaugKi3ol9gDQHJ.jpg","overview":"某大学文学史专业的学生张庆熟读古典名著，但他用现代观念剖析古代文学史的论文命题不被叶教授所认可。为了让叶教授成为自己的研究生导师，张庆决定通过写小说的方式，进一步阐述自己想要表达的观点。 在他的小说中，身世神秘的少年——范闲，自小跟随奶奶生活在海边小城澹州，随着一位老师的突然造访，他看似平静的生活开始直面重重的危机与考验。在神秘老师和一位蒙眼守护者的指点下，范闲熟识药性药理，修炼霸道真气并精进武艺，而后接连化解了诸多危局。因对身世之谜的好奇，范闲离开澹州，前赴京都。 在京都，范闲饱尝人间冷暖并坚守对正义、良善的坚持，历经家族、江湖、庙堂的种种考验与锤炼，书写了光彩的人生传奇。","release_date":"2019-11-26","first_air_date":"2019-11-26","year":"2019","runtime":"","episode_run_time":"45","number_of_episodes":83,"number_of_seasons":3,"genres":["剧情","喜剧","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","War & Politics"],"languages":["普通话"],"countries":["China"],"tmdb_rating":"8.0 / 10 from 124 users","tmdb_rating_average":8,"tmdb_votes":124,"imdb_id":"tt11273352","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt11273352/","imdb_rating":"8.2 / 10 from 2708 users","imdb_rating_average":"8.2","imdb_votes":"2708","directors":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1912963,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"孙皓","original_name":"孙皓","popularity":0.3186,"profile_path":"/glSr4ySHNssLErAHYXYwbyor45A.jpg","credit_id":"6810dd43930c895e280fc4d9","department":"Directing","job":"Director"}],"producers":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1864756,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"张维","original_name":"Zhang Wei","popularity":0.0485,"profile_path":"/A02BSEZL6cagngv2YghY1YB3IIh.jpg","credit_id":"665a2b423e322d6e078e4cef","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2729797,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"曹华益","original_name":"曹华益","popularity":0.2712,"profile_path":"/oWcRM0UwvxPgcDPSrEoYmhhXGVN.jpg","credit_id":"665a2b2014f4ee416d8e4c61","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":3111282,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"龚宇","original_name":